{"title": "Fetish of Callarduran Smoothhands", "pageid": 3624, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands", "categories": ["Rings", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands_Icon.png/300px-Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fb/Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Fetish of Callarduran Smoothhands image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands_Icon.png/300px-Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Fetish_of_Callarduran_Smoothhands_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Fetish of Callarduran Smoothhands</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> that allows the wearer to cast the Invisibility spell once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The smooth, six-pointed star on this ring is beset with small <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> gemstones, as befits a talisman of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Callarduran_Smoothhands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"god\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Callarduran_Smoothhands\">god</a></span> of mining and patron of <a href=\"/wiki/Deep_gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deep gnome\">deep gnomes</a>.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.p