file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_UND_CallarduranTrinket</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_CallarduranTrinket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_CallarduranTrinket\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">82261770-46e3-403c-8ab0-b6cdb185d29a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:82261770-46e3-403c-8ab0-b6cdb185d29a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:82261770-46e3-403c-8ab0-b6cdb185d29a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_DeadInWater_CallarduranTrinket</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_DeadInWater_CallarduranTrinket+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_DeadInWater_CallarduranTrinket+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisibility_(spell)\" title=\"Invisibility (spell)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp/60px-Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp/80px-Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp/40px-Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Invisibility_spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisibility_(spell)\" title=\"Invisibility (spell)\">Invisibility</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a level 2 spell (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-610&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;408</span>: On one of the dead <a href=\"/wiki/Deep_gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deep gnome\">deep gnomes</a> that a pair of duergar are throwing into the lake</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If the party talk to the <a href=\"/wiki/Duergar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Duergar\">duergar</a> they must to succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/25px-Perception_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/38px-Perception_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/50px-Perception_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Perception\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Perception_Icon.png/25px-Perception_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Perception_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/25px-Deception_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/38px-Deception_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/50px-Deception_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deception\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png/25px-Deception_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Deception_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deception\" title=\"Deception\">Deception</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/38px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/50px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sleight of Hand\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png/25px-Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/46/Sleight_of_Hand_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> check before this item can be looted. Alternatively, the ring can be taken directly from one of the duergar corpses after killing them. It is also possible to offer to lend a hand and loot the deep gnomes before they get shoved off.</li>\n<li>Looting the ring grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Urchin#You_Can't_Take_It_with_You\" title=\"Urchin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"You Can't Take It with You\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Urchin#You_Can't_Take_It_with_You\" title=\"Urchin\">You Can't Take It with You</a> inspiration to party members with the <a href=\"/wiki/Urchin\" title=\"Urchin\">Urchin</a> background.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201428\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.088 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3742/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43672/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10974/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4